{"uid":"dafe7403de3dfe1d","name":"test_snapshot_refuses_a_workflow_bound_to_a_different_project","fullName":"tests.test_workspace_revisions_snapshot_workflow#test_snapshot_refuses_a_workflow_bound_to_a_different_project","historyId":"125e88d73928ec5f93b400332bc3ef0e","time":{"start":1789927789866,"stop":1789927789923,"duration":57},"description":"The default test identity (``@test``) is a platform admin (see\n    ``conftest.py::app_config``), and an admin bypasses the 3-tier\n    visibility model everywhere in this codebase -- so proving this refusal\n    for real needs a genuinely non-admin caller: one who has the\n    ``caliber.operator`` platform scope (to reach the route at all) and an\n    editor role on the *calling* project, but is neither a member of the\n    *other* project nor the workflow's owner. Mirrors\n    ``test_workspace_revisions_snapshot_skill.py``'s equivalent test.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The default test identity (<code>@test</code>) is a platform admin (see<br />\n<code>conftest.py::app_config</code>), and an admin bypasses the 3-tier<br />\nvisibility model everywhere in this codebase -- so proving this refusal<br />\nfor real needs a genuinely non-admin caller: one who has the<br />\n<code>caliber.operator</code> platform scope (to reach the route at all) and an<br />\neditor role on the <em>calling</em> project, but is neither a member of the<br />\n<em>other</em> project nor the workflow's owner. Mirrors<br />\n<code>test_workspace_revisions_snapshot_skill.py</code>'s equivalent test.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789926174306,"stop":1789926174307,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1789